msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2dbdd4fda987e99823d135b351b0430616a6e3cb39a842cb38d676372c25e3f
#. default-sha256: 24ed692e79247627ecfd403dbdf8f27d16361261d00a32919ca34ab5618f07f0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am, even now, putting her through a harrowing experience.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Digging up the memories "
"she locked away,⟪k:3⟫the past she wanted to pretend never happened,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 지금도 ⟪k:1⟫지젤에게 가혹한 짓을 저지르고 있다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫지젤이 부정하고픈 과거를, ⟪k:4⟫"
"떠올리기 싫은 것을――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c9866f54b716b9d298cd9aed90e4656c7f369d0a80ba44a4dbc4f2b30e349b5
#. default-sha256: 64e35e8e315d2d2e75dd67e58176f5f3c724ea4ad8cc9067d99dde7105db6aab
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ get her back to who she once was... ⟪k:3⟫even if means forcing her to "
"endure this."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫그렇게 해서라도……,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는 지젤을 되찾아야 한다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8572E743_F1B9_4725_83AC_301F6C7F53F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfa639d4bc3108f28695fe881b5e0dfecc69ddb910dc3f8e16bf016bd319236d
#. default-sha256: 98f687b67f4f640cba696c4d015ee6a0922eba4e9661be6822eda603f47fb953
