msgid "⟪k:0⟫She ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ remember everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모든 것을 ⟪k:1⟫떠올리게 해야 한다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BE807F3_EF9C_4755_8CDA_4DB5B59BF213
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3c139930f72d391dc9e8075795fc9b14edd7f817426118a064c91b3c68287a7
