msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1BE807F3_EF9C_4755_8CDA_4DB5B59BF213"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because I need to know:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 지젤이 저택의 시녀가 된 이유와――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이 저택에 얽힌 ⟪k:3⟫모든 것을――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_91DC5CA3_2C4E_492C_86F1_9139E4788EA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e16a4b5a62d471285517fa59ac57496a8b4005e030edc75c00965e74503e6570
