#: scenario5:scenario5_4CD12567_0497_448A_AC61_D78236F3671E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b905fc1899cb1c3a41ea63719595e0b78cb72f63374915e7e0fdeec636ba544
