msgid "⟪k:0⟫What was her “why” referring to?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 「어째서」는 ⟪k:1⟫무엇을 가리킨 것일까."

#: scenario5:scenario5_85F8AD58_4AC2_4079_825B_FA8B440ED1C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 630342cb5fd41415c7c458ad3fb8026f7e09418b15385298b5983efd51ce28b6
