msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85F8AD58_4AC2_4079_825B_FA8B440ED1C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There’s still more we need to see, though,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……하지만 ⟪k:1⟫아직 끝낼 수는 없다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_433AD9C5_8D01_4816_9DFA_2A7298F26081
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09527efc35d6a8ee9a7534e344e405c4183d4b0b38f78e560eaa67f02fea0cc7
