msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Perfect darkness embraces us once more.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can see nothing—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"not even the woman beside me—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫한 치 앞조차 보이지 않는 ⟪k:4⟫진정한 어둠이 ⟪k:5⟫우리를 다시 뒤덮었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A6033E7A_86D1_4124_8A68_8D00A54D929B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b6cf9f822ed0f33b50180875393e837bbe098bf574349c4e18bf979ffa2c577
#. default-sha256: 5c35719c6fad6f33467636355e885dcf60d6cc61fa7c75fea3bebb61dcfdbafa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A6033E7A_86D1_4124_8A68_8D00A54D929B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I shall not let go of her hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만―― ⟪k:1⟫이 손은 결코 놓지 않겠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_02E1BE16_7ECF_44F9_A8FF_F0CFE70C0D60
