#: scenario5:scenario5_C060641D_4200_474C_9BD0_D89E2D008FCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d5a8a551f7cd11489b7fcb354724f4200931e113adc18e14d3d6d210a56110e
