msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I feel sick... ⟪k:1⟫like there’s still something in my stomach...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(울렁거려……, ⟪k:1⟫아직 ⟪k:2⟫위장에 뭐가 남은 것 같아……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E5D3A224_9EDE_4B53_83CA_1C1A4BC009CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
