msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You really should have something.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You need to keep up your energy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Unless "
"you want to conk out again in an hour."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런 말은 마. ⟪k:1⟫아무것도 안 먹으면 ⟪k:2⟫간신히 깨어난 건데, ⟪k:3⟫도로 잠들 거 아니야."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E536F281_7C9D_48E6_AE41_FA1CDF20EDC4
