#: scenario5:scenario5_80B48B37_A6B2_40BA_B6EE_78792F4B1CF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd8c6b73e6ca4d821abd4dabda32bcff19dac483fffb1346a8670fb19187edba
