msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You start losing all hope once the cold gets that deep in you, reaches down to your core. "
"⟪k:1⟫Take me at my word, please. Just one sip."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫몸 속이 차가우면 ⟪k:1⟫마음까지 차가워져서 주체가 안 되는 법이야. ⟪k:2⟫속는 셈 치고 ⟪k:3⟫한 모"
"금만 마셔 봐."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7D97BC32_EE95_4F2F_B76E_65E92F2F9125
