msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A heart-wrenchingly pleasant aroma wafted up with the steam from within the wooden "
"cup."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫나무 컵에 부어진 우유에선――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫가슴이 뭉클해질 만큼 ⟪k:5⟫편안한 향기가 났다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_36CE89BA_03A9_492A_991E_12640834E656
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
