msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the warmth that spread through me brought tears to my eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫놀랍도록 따스해서 ⟪k:1⟫눈물이 나왔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EA65986D_F1E3_4ECF_89F3_6CE27629C216
