msgid "⟪k:0⟫after which he said with a smile, “You should take it easy for the day.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이어서 ⟪k:1⟫「오늘은 푹 쉬어」란 말을 웃으며 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D684B6FC_6432_4FC1_82EE_FDDC9D59E8FD
