msgid "⟪k:0⟫It felt like I was somewhere far, far away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왠지 많이 ⟪k:1⟫머나먼 곳까지 온 것만 같아――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E269BFDF_55EC_42A1_BBB9_9183FA7E11AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3b66278425c24a0acdc6e0cfab722962afbc49dbd28f15f4aad4be3229e4c77
