msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E269BFDF_55EC_42A1_BBB9_9183FA7E11AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At times, I felt like a lost child, and at times like a sickly old woman on her deathbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫돌아갈 길을 잃은 아이 같은 심정이 들다가, ⟪k:1⟫살 날이 얼마 안 남은 노인 같은 심정도 들었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2E995B53_ECFE_4853_9B98_BD4A27A566B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdf2090f61b8a836f347f2b220a261de622e987451f2c871145614655c1c72e7
#. default-sha256: 70870348aaa9bdc57f398e47dd32ad315c8ae60ffc4076078457ac6a75666b48
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2E995B53_ECFE_4853_9B98_BD4A27A566B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the fact that each moment that went by was another moment I was alive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫그러는 동안에도―― 내가 살아 있단 사실도."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5535E88D_699A_4D9E_BAA8_2173E89A24F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d827aadc6e8a21ba5e577ca7484846b95ced8462a5761d96e2b95660c48f168
