msgid "⟪k:0⟫Only after losing something do you realize how much you need it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫한 차례 잃고 나니, ⟪k:1⟫그 소중함을 깨달은 것만 같았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_65832FCB_4CB8_46B4_8ABE_A9D7E48B2538
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1257507896029130497e803e1f893b457e8cb46c49eb01884471fe699e25011
#. default-sha256: 13a1bec384891e0677d2ae97e064d033fe766137be900127a22058c87c4f8ed8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_65832FCB_4CB8_46B4_8ABE_A9D7E48B2538"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Warm milk, the light shining through the window, and a bed that smelled like springtime. "
"⟪k:1⟫With those three things, my heart slowly began to defrost,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫따뜻한 우유와 ⟪k:1⟫창문을 통해 들어오는 빛, ⟪k:2⟫햇님의 내음이 나는 침대. ⟪k:3⟫겨우 그것만으"
"로도 ⟪k:4⟫내 빙결된 마음은 ⟪k:5⟫천천히 녹기 시작했고――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A83026BF_2DCD_437B_98BC_EE8A520351AB
