msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8D268C74_F854_44C6_8820_FC4162AF73CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We’re pretty remote as a result, and the harvest isn’t fantastic... ⟪k:1⟫but I’m sure you’ll "
"find it comfortable here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The rest of the villagers will be glad to have you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런 만큼 ⟪k:1⟫번성도 안 하는 벽촌이지만……, ⟪k:2⟫평온하게 살 수는 있을 거야. ⟪k:3⟫마을 사람들"
"도 ⟪k:4⟫너를 환영할걸."

