msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Houses were scattered across an area that seemed far too large for only a hundred people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백 명이 살기엔 넓게 느껴지는 범위에 ⟪k:1⟫민가가 띄엄띄엄 보였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BB3CF46_DC55_4CB5_99A0_966551048D3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e256ac7a9a75a1490ba67dc31730715cd494984a41bef9846cf59dd7b5280e5
#. default-sha256: b4dc7143d0d907cd2ad62b5a1d8a7ae980245c5f29914a6f95b3e72878ee33a6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1BB3CF46_DC55_4CB5_99A0_966551048D3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh no. We were drifters fortunate enough to come across some decent-looking land, so we "
"stuck around."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아니, ⟪k:1⟫우리는 떠돌던 몸이야. ⟪k:2⟫운 좋게 살기 괜찮아 보이는 땅을 찾아내서 ⟪k:3⟫지금 이렇"
"게 사는 거지."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5C2A7BB_E7EB_482E_A653_EC6EF6E0E3FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2a4dc82d75001a151a66982da2d417f44880f84af9eca5016095031b2cd2a2e
#. default-sha256: f80ca4fee8c333b2f6cd5072aee91ff28088d9a48f83e6f4feb700bd09229d35
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5C2A7BB_E7EB_482E_A653_EC6EF6E0E3FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There weren’t hundreds, but ⟪k:1⟫thousands⟪k:2⟫ of people bustling about. Merchants from "
"afar came in droves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이런 백 명짜리 마을이 아니라 ⟪k:1⟫수천 명이 오갔지. ⟪k:2⟫멀리서 장사하러 오는 사람도 많아서――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_71F229FB_7362_4221_9345_9FEAF100B178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc9babfd19b95f05513639927f21ada2083866abcba1d985b327a07d5c67f81f
#. default-sha256: 10e6773c355e240ed483ce0c0c02bac30ff09296fbb75a18655d13f9e19d612f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_71F229FB_7362_4221_9345_9FEAF100B178"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was much like how the capital is now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Actually, this area was more open to "
"foreigners."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그야말로 ⟪k:1⟫현 수도랑 비슷했을걸. ⟪k:2⟫아니―― 수도보다 이방인에게 개방적이었을 수 있겠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_94A85F03_4F3D_42CC_94C6_F0FC1D1FA8EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66afb3c49247df780e696250f40f31acf627351a8fe111048996a36ebf199d59
#. default-sha256: a96c11482c083a941606f1680c58117a33b325c81b51b35a29411334c312af9c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94A85F03_4F3D_42CC_94C6_F0FC1D1FA8EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what happens when a place is wiped from history.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I couldn’t tell you how "
"reliable the tablets are,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫역사에서 묻힌 도시잖아. ⟪k:1⟫뭐, ⟪k:2⟫남은 자료가 얼마나 정확한진 ⟪k:3⟫나도 모르겠지만――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DCB8A0FE_8FC7_433B_A4F5_85816AD8B2FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9edaa2bab3aca7486ad4103f492dbb99987a5961fa78608377d07e381ae8fddf
#. default-sha256: 745747cf8eebb103601d266ef3a00c778aa2c9fe06c4074871b35b931aece96d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DCB8A0FE_8FC7_433B_A4F5_85816AD8B2FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but if you take them at their word,⟪k:1⟫this city lost everything in just a single week."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그걸 믿는다 치면⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 도시는 불과 일주일만에 모든 걸 잃었다 해."

#: scenario5:scenario5_01E120F0_5D86_4DBE_8874_E0BBDAE99807
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 995fbea33a64cdb42579474265957a5910d877585105d2968686fa458c79fe52
#. default-sha256: 5a08e1eaee0601dd4fad45533279db0a6ef2591841b2635ad2911b6600223071
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_01E120F0_5D86_4DBE_8874_E0BBDAE99807"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네………?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6B93008A_EC60_4FA0_B00D_41BDD9715DAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 858cbd2b7ec4308e72e220794e9e95c588dc2e24084321148c0205c6cd001908
#. default-sha256: dd6123b25b89c9012c68824448a83424703767ff4bb0a23b566e9f4af6d14c5b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6B93008A_EC60_4FA0_B00D_41BDD9715DAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People, crops, livestock, all dead.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maybe it was a natural disaster, a famine, a "
"plague—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can’t say for sure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫사람, ⟪k:1⟫작물, ⟪k:2⟫가축 모두. ⟪k:3⟫절멸했거든. ⟪k:4⟫천재지변인지, ⟪k:5⟫기근인지, ⟪k:6⟫역병"
"인지―― 진상은 불분명해."

#: scenario5:scenario5_117F95DD_3C55_4F03_ABF0_59459188078A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24f09c38a87075fada85ddbc5f140af2d5876e2a65f56ea672b69a1944b75d46
#. default-sha256: 74d9b5d050965cd0a22cca505a3b6d0831adf4438d28ffab452552750f75b6e1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_117F95DD_3C55_4F03_ABF0_59459188078A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This is what the tablets said, though:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 사람들은 이렇게 말했어."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B9A84221_0EC5_406E_8208_5C64ADD6A369
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea7a10df40dfca62b6ccd69bcc154e8ba4e7ea43a51b356f5358d187013016a2
#. default-sha256: e715896422db3746e2ff5731cb351adbc4aef6e979d471154e4adadedad7608b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B9A84221_0EC5_406E_8208_5C64ADD6A369"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cursed... ⟪k:3⟫by the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……마녀의 ⟪k:3⟫저주……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_60EC949C_4071_48D2_B958_B5D71D85B43E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1190a47be1475d3347e2a5dce6276779132bc5e68e20dcec8457f83d546039eb
#. default-sha256: 60f16ec6fc561c0af2f3ddc4e24dcce3022be11aaad6d8bfbb491773ef198c00
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_60EC949C_4071_48D2_B958_B5D71D85B43E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Look over there. You see that river?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There used to be a magnificent bridge crossing "
"it,⟪k:3⟫but there’s hardly anything left of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저 강 건너쪽을 ⟪k:1⟫봐 볼래? ⟪k:2⟫과거에는 저 강에도 멋들어진 다리가 있었다는데, ⟪k:3⟫지금은 "
"흔적도 안 남았어."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FFD4F708_AFC7_4C14_B632_0ECFC247B945
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a13fde90157369e568a2414f1e76d625cf6dc3a52ee5484f7646c52e96bb91ff
#. default-sha256: 669f20aa2f36e5d44ffbde3983c3dac7b0df1efa8d55c85bd4d7e78791cb5ec8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FFD4F708_AFC7_4C14_B632_0ECFC247B945"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The deeper parts of the forest are so dense you can’t see anything but tree trunks and "
"leaves. It’s an eerie place, wrapped in a cloud of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫안쪽까지 가면 ⟪k:1⟫빽빽한 나무가 시야를 가리는 ⟪k:2⟫으스스한 숲이야. ⟪k:3⟫암녹빛이 우거진 어"
"둠의 숲이란…… 표현이 적절할까."

#: scenario5:scenario5_73D700D3_E82C_41C4_88AA_A2945784D3AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73D700D3_E82C_41C4_88AA_A2945784D3AB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6FC3B647_77D4_416C_8EDA_DBCDDDB59CCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9270ee55290182abc38bbb74fb41c1dbf02d01c90ee1496c415f6982281eb2b
#. default-sha256: b4edcab0e3ead67819e4a20e1f45e35a69b56316d2f2daaf17ed12bf6b77200e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6FC3B647_77D4_416C_8EDA_DBCDDDB59CCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The city was so large that the mansion was actually in its borders.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My guess is the "
"bridge was built to mark the road leading to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫과거의 도시는 ⟪k:1⟫그 저택도 아우르는 규모였다고 해. ⟪k:2⟫강에 걸린 다리는 ⟪k:3⟫저택으로 가"
"는 길이기도 했을 거야."

#: scenario5:scenario5_051B9A84_0600_41B1_95E8_D61DE028237E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c28f6d93aae490e305700ab1199bf1adee45c0f2f5e6d8fec6a0d4bf346281a
#. default-sha256: c232df368e0a66eb8990a294b64d075289097bf95326fed5a1994671080dbe18
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_051B9A84_0600_41B1_95E8_D61DE028237E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The witch living in the mansion goes by the name Morgana.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫According to the records, "
"someone by that same name was executed in this area for witchcraft,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――저택에는 ⟪k:1⟫모르가나가 살아.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫기록에 남은 바로는 ⟪k:4⟫이 땅에서 처형된 마녀의 이"
"름이지."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CA3AB338_C0EA_43C3_ABD5_6AD6461B8F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eef535aa1f44867d41a9ac51201251b86914b1eea7029b67234709fe8a94e2a7
#. default-sha256: af79c03800a1ca1f0aef039c1805fc7047c21455087141483dca672c192aa20d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CA3AB338_C0EA_43C3_ABD5_6AD6461B8F5E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and even in death, she continues to bear her grudge against mankind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모르가나는 ⟪k:1⟫죽어서도 ⟪k:2⟫사람들을 원망하고 있어."

#: scenario5:scenario5_55EDDC48_7963_4D42_A334_C643011CDE3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_55EDDC48_7963_4D42_A334_C643011CDE3C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F4E6C79C_2C08_4AD1_876A_9C16DE88B421
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65f3e62982413344e28daa40267407a4b47866bf6646bf1e03b2dd2adb70744e
#. default-sha256: 6c6df1fc2395a2cba931c24da6c964ccbcfc85e120ab623c269706100fff2253
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F4E6C79C_2C08_4AD1_876A_9C16DE88B421"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Who knows how much of it is true, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Truth or fiction, the story has taken "
"root in this region."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――뭐, ⟪k:1⟫다 미심쩍은 내용이지만. ⟪k:2⟫그래도 ⟪k:3⟫마녀 일화는 ⟪k:4⟫이 일대에선 그럭저럭 유"
"명해."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A8E6B3BB_0125_4BA0_BD91_686AB139DCB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c2816550e3c09aee3b1c7025f9ec0d5715f3e421f90af6363830bfaf1d05353
#. default-sha256: 32f00ff5e70e056f6a9d9ab0bdf50c0bfff8857cced4652fa6e45bae1f868af5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A8E6B3BB_0125_4BA0_BD91_686AB139DCB8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The city’s history may be lost, but the legend of the witch continues to be told. ⟪k:1⟫"
"People have a tendency to keep stories alive that scare them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫도시의 역사는 묻혔나 본데……, ⟪k:1⟫마녀 일화는 또 남았더라고. ⟪k:2⟫무릇 사람이란 ⟪k:3⟫무서운 "
"건 남기는 법인가 봐."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A00DB224_71A5_421F_BC40_3C1C64945FBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 698308d5d53e3451966d4e7728d1022ccadcd677e68b51402c635e0cd09b2453
#. default-sha256: 4dbf87e42ae98576c5388190ce9104e10cf0a955b9f56bc99917d583972e77c0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A00DB224_71A5_421F_BC40_3C1C64945FBD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫I’m fine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아뇨……, ⟪k:1⟫괜찮아요……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_438F3829_68B8_4599_9D7D_4D1794A6D458
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f3ba8dcaae784a4694f87ebcc75e1baf649116e8bc18aa94137243c35bc1798
#. default-sha256: 74604619210d87ac3a6e33df05cb8b2b6ef13ecdaafa17e95edbfeb33afc929b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_438F3829_68B8_4599_9D7D_4D1794A6D458"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Better safe than sorry, if you ask me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aside from the mansion, this is as peaceful "
"a village as you’ll find."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그냥 전승이라도 ⟪k:1⟫조심하는 게 제일이지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……저택 소문만 빼면 ⟪k:4⟫이 마을은 평화로"
"워."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2E783A11_1860_446C_A23B_F33F058CE9A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fa9c88ee5d5ce2c2c41ec582e5b0880faf142c6528cd190261436cad0206415
#. default-sha256: 34ff7c59ff9722d63f85ff3991028d9ceabb70d6bb39727a5f890320420ec3be
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2E783A11_1860_446C_A23B_F33F058CE9A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(But I don’t remember any cursed witch.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫거기에 저주받은 마녀가 있었나?)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1E407112_215F_4868_8D42_B36E72810C7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 028d1132a5f1578c570403126340fbc769caa0bb7adfa7bea3daf61cbeaf1cae
#. default-sha256: ac8bffffad076acd663563eaceb12ff85ba88109855287502ef4282c5d93f0a6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1E407112_215F_4868_8D42_B36E72810C7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Maybe the rumors about a witch living there were spread by him—)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(저주받은 마녀 소문은 ⟪k:1⟫어쩌면……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FF59E07_262D_4A5D_A382_0E3E6EF15DDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1869dd260dfcde6b0c7439335c27bd2cd75073de25fe10b04b9c2733b84c1755
#. default-sha256: 5798deda96bc3bbc70084883ad5fbb3da0ef2b89ff59ebc41c7e070600ab3c60
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FF59E07_262D_4A5D_A382_0E3E6EF15DDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With nowhere else to go, I ended up in this small village.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There was no "
"denying that there was very little to speak of here,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어디로도 돌아갈 수 없어진 내가 다다른 ⟪k:2⟫작은 마을.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그곳은 ⟪k:5⟫아무것도 없"
"긴 했지만――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A19B5A9B_6DEE_40FC_AF38_4A0E1A518C20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23a80046b6cf218938b813f8cc5ffea86a88b2255cff98171f3319d4fe27d76a
#. default-sha256: d8326f1cb8c61694a7846d356fc5e569eb681b6a57da4a9ee273f30b6892a8d8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A19B5A9B_6DEE_40FC_AF38_4A0E1A518C20"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I found peace in that nothingness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 ⟪k:1⟫아무것도 없는 점 자체가 ⟪k:2⟫내 눈에는 평온으로 보였다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_71E64260_D9AD_4229_8124_626865BE8383
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 660761e6cdbc1407989760d5cce60667493895903713834e998d4ceba53bdc15
#. default-sha256: 697b408c136fa3d7f026f2f8e64f393ce25cc856c24afbf7f1ed524b8c289247
