msgid "⟪k:0⟫There, the entire rest of the village was gathered, all eyes on me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫거기선 ⟪k:1⟫마을 사람들이 모두 모여 ⟪k:2⟫나를 노려보고 있었다."

