msgid "⟪k:0⟫I thought you were better than that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네가 그런 여성일 줄은 몰랐어……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A1109304_B5CC_4ECA_80B0_44EBBDC658D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
