msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I recognized what I saw in his glare immediately, as someone who had been subjected to those "
"looks before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫그걸 즉시 파악했다. ⟪k:2⟫그렇다, ⟪k:3⟫그 감정에 찔린 적이 있는 나이기에."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DE35AE75_F8F6_4813_B452_C6B0B3238E0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f0023adab8670d54d111283b443ee91a690da8ae78f4dd910b757b7789fe921
