msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But why? ⟪k:1⟫For what reason was he looking at me like that?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I couldn’t make sense "
"of what was happening,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫어째서. ⟪k:2⟫왜 ⟪k:3⟫이 사람이 그런 눈으로 나를 보는 걸까. ⟪k:4⟫나는 이해가 미치"
"질 않아서――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_ED3008A9_2A5D_4DAB_93D2_37C16F41C2A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bca8b6bbc30da512a94f16f0b9fe7538b62e52a4ad077c4abf5a5f158e64f72c
