msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_ED3008A9_2A5D_4DAB_93D2_37C16F41C2A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s been a rise in reports of people having things stolen lately.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This village "
"is too small to attract bandits, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫요즘 들어 ⟪k:1⟫도난을 당했단 사람이 많아졌어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이렇게 작은 마을이니 ⟪k:4⟫외부 도둑일 "
"리는 없지."

#: scenario5:scenario5_AAAC2A8E_6BA8_472D_A4E7_0F7169A22D08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5eb5bdaa6a8265a38048f5ae3e2eca5f6a38b20efed78c5c814124f7b23dab96
#. default-sha256: 663222c008d6522bde2fe3c75800e3a2b4b435a069e3d6929bd87d28d56503d5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_AAAC2A8E_6BA8_472D_A4E7_0F7169A22D08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Since the lord now demands we pay him taxes,⟪k:1⟫even the smallest item lost can have a "
"dramatic impact⟪k:2⟫on a family’s living conditions."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫영주가 납세를 요구하는 지금은 ⟪k:1⟫어떤 사소한 악행이라도 ⟪k:2⟫생활에 큰 영향을 줘."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5CFE3B3C_D1DD_4C45_9F63_DB3477E48086
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3c6d80a420100a67c0c862ef91f205b6b94140b004d0cf28f5c962596aa70bf
#. default-sha256: 8cc715a53389c0c509a810d703d4eba694228bb0b71e66b33259f6c323d3fe8e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5CFE3B3C_D1DD_4C45_9F63_DB3477E48086"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫W— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wait just a second!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I haven’t stolen anything!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why do you "
"think I—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자……, ⟪k:1⟫잠깐만요!! ⟪k:2⟫전 ⟪k:3⟫도둑질 같은 건 ⟪k:4⟫안 했어요! ⟪k:5⟫왜 저한테 혐의가……!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_66B2A70E_213E_4DF5_9A43_B1CD45924866
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9688d1d9144aded00d48045e116bbd6fd4f49ebbd145eda58a6d65ce90255e3
