msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’re⟪k:2⟫ the one who’s lying!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’ve been playing us for fools this whole "
"time!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫거짓말은 네가 하는 거지! ⟪k:1⟫넌 우리를 쭉 속인 거야!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2DE4A7A7_1C37_424B_83EE_566A54AA5072
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
