msgstr "⟪k:0⟫맙소사……, ⟪k:1⟫그건 ⟪k:2⟫제 탓이 아니에요!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8163E2B3_3D7C_4182_9274_90B70E324F86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1dd02da31e1a440784675202350f7a2b521df495c018bd01bae271e08e9b19f8
