#: scenario5:scenario5_07CE9BFB_FE4C_48B9_B58A_1FA774A61BAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0497635075e16a23d4e550de0eca9c09f9e6a3049c8fff3e76d80bfb0afbbef4
