msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫B-⟪k:1⟫But... ⟪k:2⟫No... ⟪k:3⟫They’re framing me!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I didn’t steal anything, I swear!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫세, ⟪k:1⟫세상에……, ⟪k:2⟫그건 ⟪k:3⟫담합한 거예요! ⟪k:4⟫전 ⟪k:5⟫진짜로 안 했단 말이에요……!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_39BEBCC9_2C5E_4DC5_8960_C50D0D10651F
