msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nnh... ⟪k:1⟫A-⟪k:2⟫Amédée, please believe me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You of all people should believe me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………으, ⟪k:1⟫……아, ⟪k:2⟫아메데 씨, ⟪k:3⟫믿어 줘요……!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫당신만큼은 믿어 주세요……!"

