msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94ACC3EA_EBF0_41B6_BE5B_0353C9535FBD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, return the things you’ve stolen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫훔친 걸 돌려 줘……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2CC58FCF_9C1F_4CAE_82B7_7BAAA7793360
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b92a8fad75cad0b7f3883843041c086110f6a2a6ff5690b128ffeb9f9e720687
