"⟪k:0⟫I can’t! I never stole anything!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How am I supposed to return something I don’t "
"have?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫못 해요! ⟪k:1⟫훔친 적도 없단 말이에요! ⟪k:2⟫갖고 있지도 않은 걸 ⟪k:3⟫어떻게 돌려 주란 거예요!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7962D530_F4FC_484F_A911_D2C7BD9A0824
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90bf350b9ee22d13585fbb4f1b94dcea492897c599b8a16863cd7f7bffe77a53
