msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I see, so you’ve already moved the stolen goods.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She said she doesn’t have them "
"anymore, folks.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How should we deal with this?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아이고야, ⟪k:1⟫장물은 이미 어디다 옮겨 놨나 봐.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫못 돌려 주겠다는데―― 어쩔래, ⟪k:4⟫마"
"을 친구들."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9DDF163_599F_40B5_AA7C_F08FABBA463E
