msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(이 사람들―― 폭정 때문에 완전히 달라졌어……!)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C87E74CD_788D_448B_8126_379F49F89D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ea1e23adff5a779a960819d9aceea14b7c07c6f4c7ecd0aa7940c1247f01e25
